Nethack has "owners"?  Could that really be the mentality going on
here?  Even though it's an ancient open source game originating with
other people; even though whatever stewardship the devteam claims is a
surely a product of accident and personal connections as much as it is
of pure coding ability; even though there are many demonstrably
talented and/or interested contributors who are not on the devteam?

If this is the mentality, the devteam model really needs to disappear,
now.


